# Unit calls of ActorMoveByVectorOver (81:A687), which no code refers to:
# the actor moved by a vector from a direction set divided by Y. By JSL in
# a level (stage_a0_s0), M and X 8-bit, DB $80 (its vector sets at
# $80:BBB9 and the CPU's divider), the actor the record at $092B, the
# machine put back after each. Set 0 facing 1 (its facing byte $093F):
# both parts negative ($FFF74F, $FFFDAC), divided by 3. Set 4 ($04) facing
# 0: both positive ($003556, $00288B), divided by 5.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a0_s0.state
wait 2
set 00093F 01
call 81A687 long p=30 db=80 d=092B x=00 y=03
set 00093F 00
call 81A687 long p=30 db=80 d=092B x=04 y=05
